And whereas, such attempt has been accompanied by threats of violence and
                        bloodshed and a display of armed force; and such attempt and acts and
                        threats are revolutionary and treasonable in character;

And whereas Her Majesty’s cabinet have informed her that such contemplated
                        action was unlawful and would lead to bloodshed and riot, and have implored
                        and demanded of her to desist from and renounce such proposed action;
